<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00639">
	<title>Display and control</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>The Highway Driving Assist operation status is visible in the Driving Assist view on the instrument cluster. For more information, refer to <xref href="t00155.dita#t00155"/>.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03952">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03953">
								<title>Standby State</title>
								<image href="images/N_SP327_C00_051.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e03954">
								<title>Operating State</title>
								<image href="images/N_SP327_C00_050.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The Highway Driving Assist status displays on the instrument cluster as follows:</p>
		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03955">
			<li>
				<p>Highway Driving Assist indicator, whether there is a vehicle ahead and the selected distance level is displayed.</p>
				<ul id="e03956">
					<li>
						<p>Green: Operating</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>Gray: Standby</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>White blinking: Accelerator engaged</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>Unlit: <term translate="no">OFF</term></p>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Set speed</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Whether there is a vehicle ahead and the selected headway</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Whether the lane is detected or not</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Lane Following Assist indicator</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="tip" id="e03957">
			<ul id="e03958">
				<li>
					<p>For more information about the display symbols and colors, refer to <xref href="t00496.dita#t00496"/> and <xref href="t00588.dita#t00588"/>.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>The images or colors may display differently depending on the specifications of the instrument cluster or theme.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00638.dita#t00638" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Highway Driving Assist</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>